  "content": "<p>此模组是為&nbsp;<a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/crackers-wither-storm-mod\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Cracker's Wither Storm Mod</a> 和&nbsp;<a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/enderite-mod-for-forge\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Enderite Mod</a> 的擴充模組</p>\n<p>這是我的第一個專案</p>\n<p>我有 Discord 帳號</p>\n<p>加入 Discord <a href=\"https://discord.gg/5BWTwGf8Rt\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">這裡</a></p>\n<p>我並非抄襲「Cracker's Wither Storm Mod」模組</p>\n<p>新增爆炸方塊、武器、新物品、合成配方、新陷阱</p>\n<p>我獨自開發，但與「nonamecrackers2」無關</p>\n<p>合成教學圖片：抱歉，我無法上傳圖片</p>\n<p>合成教學檔案：在「Additional Files」中、預告影片及&nbsp;<a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/jei\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Just Enough Items</a></p>\n<p>請所有人按照我創造模式物品欄中的爆炸方塊數量（已存在合成配方的爆炸方塊除外），然後全部丟棄（除了必須使用鑽石鎬挖掘的4個堅硬方塊，以及必須使用終極炸彈挖掘的2個最堅硬方塊），放進TNT鍛造台（1.19.4 V2、1.19.2 V3、1.18.2 V2）</p>\n<p>我已刪除TNT鍛造台和指令方塊鍛造台</p>\n<p>取得爆炸方塊？按下鍵盤按鍵（舊版）：</p>\n<p>N：自然</p>\n<p>B：建築</p>\n<p>M：礦物</p>\n<p>O：無爆炸</p>\n<p>K：功能</p>\n<p>P：木材與木板</p>\n<p>G：地獄</p>\n<p>I：終界</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h6>讓我的模組正常運作的説明：</h6>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/dH7X925eUaM?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/B2r6_qjKs1Y?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/wMmYbpxfsAs?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>影片更新：</p>\n<p><span><span><iframe style=\"width:640px\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/j4uHtpjXQcc?si=1Wsish6Ue6ML-kt2\" width=\"640\" height=\"377\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/ohC7vOVWi-A?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p>在我的網站下載&nbsp;<a href=\"https://sites.google.com/view/experiments-2010/home\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">這裡</a></p>\n<p>Modrinth&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fexplosive-block-crackers-wither-storm-mod-and-enderite-mod\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">這裡</a></p>\n<p>MediaFire&nbsp;<span class=\"link-removed\">連結已移除：<a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https%3a%2f%2fwww.mediafire.com%2ffolder%2f8o7fggzm80ppn%2fMy_mods\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">https://www.mediafire.com/folder/8o7fggzm80ppn/My_mods</a></span></p>\n<p>GitHub&nbsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/SuperHero2010/Explosive-Block-Cracker-s-Wither-Storm-Mod-and-Enderite-Mod\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">這裡</a></p>\n<p>MCreator（新連結）&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmcreator.net%252fmodification%252f106311%252fexplosive-block-crackers-wither-storm-mod\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">這裡</a></p>\n<p>MCreator&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmcreator.net%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">這裡</a></p>\n<p>MCreator 連結&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmcreator.net%252fdownload%252flink\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">這裡</a></p>\n<p>YouTube 頻道：<a href=\"https://youtube.com/@SuperHero20102\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://youtube.com/@SuperHero20102</a></p>\n<p>原始版本：<a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/explosive-block-original\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/explosive-block-original</a></p>\n<p>預告片（原始版本）：</p>\n<p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/Pa8ie5pgmGA?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p>GeckoLib&nbsp;<a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/geckolib\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">這裡</a></p>",
